{"term": {"label": "德", "occurrences": 1, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "姓", "id": "姓"}, {"form": "家", "id": "家"}, {"form": "就", "id": "就"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "必", "id": "必"}, {"form": "楚", "id": "楚"}, {"form": "步", "id": "步"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "牛", "id": "牛"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "罪", "id": "罪"}, {"form": "羊", "id": "羊"}, {"form": "齊", "id": "齊"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.6894806201076369, "source": "利", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.9771626925594177, "source": "利", "target": "必"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "利", "target": "家"}, {"weight": 1.6894806201076369, "source": "利", "target": "楚"}, {"weight": 0.7731898882334817, "source": "死", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "死", "target": "就"}, {"weight": 2.7880929087757464, "source": "死", "target": "罪"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "死", "target": "牛"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "死", "target": "羊"}, {"weight": 0.8909729238898652, "source": "齊", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "齊", "target": "牛"}, {"weight": 0.6678293725756554, "source": "心", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.989585212557975, "source": "異", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.940795048388543, "source": "異", "target": "姓"}, {"weight": 2.5004108363239657, "source": "異", "target": "楚"}, {"weight": 1.1786549963416462, "source": "必", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "必", "target": "家"}, {"weight": 3.3758795736778655, "source": "就", "target": "罪"}, {"weight": 0.6678293725756554, "source": "就", "target": 